{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10122060","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10122060","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1012206001:1":{"text":"이건… 잎사귀?","source_cn":"这是……一片叶子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD8064A4348F2C48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:2::2":{"text":"허니리프베어의 잎사귀","source_cn":"叶角熊的叶子","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04EA41639C8AE0FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1012206002:0":{"text":"제가 알기론 허니리프베어는 우정의 표시로 몸에 있는 잎사귀를 주고 받아요. 그런데 이 잎사귀는… 심장을 덮고 있던 거군요.","source_cn":"据我所知，叶角熊们会互相赠送身上的叶子，以示友好。而这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A7E5CEB658F3544","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1012206003:0":{"text":"허니리프베어는 감사를 표현할 때 심장 주위의 잎사귀를 선물로 주죠.","source_cn":"叶角熊想表达感激时，会把覆在心脏周围的叶子当做礼物送出。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DBB2DD0E124D6FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1012206004:0":{"text":"…휴윈에게 뭐라고 해야 하죠? 친구를 구하지 못했는데.","source_cn":"……该怎么和伊温交代啊？我们没能救下她的朋友。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8532035F0B00CF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn"